{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>「籃球女神」譚旻萱（Mandy）近日迎來26歲生日，亦是她與香港網球一哥黃澤林（Coleman）認愛後的首個生 …</p><p></p>\n<p>「籃球女神」譚旻萱（Mandy）近日迎來26歲生日，亦是她與香港網球一哥黃澤林（Coleman）認愛後的首個生日。連日來Mandy在社交平台頻頻高調「放閃」，繼早前晨早在車廂內晒出男友視角照並寫上「Perfect birthday morning」，又被網民發現愛相隨陪男友出外比賽後，她再於IG上載多張慶生照，當中更寫上西班牙文「Vamos」（加油，亦是網球壇及黃澤林的標誌性口號），隔空向男友傳情，甜蜜滿瀉。</p>\n<h2>慶生照連環出英文金句 </h2>\n<p>不過，這輯充滿復古菲林感、戴上黑框眼鏡的慶生照，卻意外在網上討論區引發網民熱烈「狙擊」。事緣Mandy在多張照片上均配上長短不一的英文感性句子，包括在與友人的大合照寫上「leave me carrying only the love, the growth, and the quiet moments that made even the hard days beautiful」，以及在吹蠟燭獨照中分別寫下「leave a little light behind」 與「26 starts now」。</p>\n<h2>遭網民狂嘲「英文版大文豪」</h2>\n<p>相關帖文隨即被網民截圖討論，不少人對她頻頻使用英文抒發感受大感反感，紛紛留言嘲諷她是「英文版大文豪」，甚至翻出其母校背景狠批：「英文水平：荔景天主教中學band 2中五」、「其實呢英文差就唔好張張英文，好Kam（尷尬）」，質疑她刻意營造文青形象。</p>\n<h2>捲疑似第三者風波 造型氣質被指愈來愈似康堤</h2>\n<p>黃澤林與康堤曾有一段情，而Mandy當初與黃澤林傳出緋聞時，曾一度被外界質疑是介入兩人感情的「疑似第三者」，令三位當事人的關係一直備受網民關注。由於康堤自小就讀國際學校，向來予人「ABC」及低調文青的氣質，日常社交平台亦多以英文分享生活；不少網民因此認為Mandy近期的打扮與發文風格「個feel愈來愈似康堤老師」，更毒舌留言指她「唔post英文會同康堤比下去」，懷疑她因介意被拿作與男友前度比較，才在生日帖文中刻意大晒英文金句，結果卻弄巧成拙，令原本甜蜜的生日放閃變成公關災難。</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179491062646024455_1406155166afc29a31f909.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"IG@ensonlau 的副本 - 2026-11-17T181532.624.png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179491062646024455_1406155166afc29a31f909.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>兩人表情都好似（圖片來源：IG相片）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179491063113732243_10874095666afc29a77acc6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179491063113732243_10874095666afc29a77acc6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：譚旻萱IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179491063215583866_621228626afc29a89159f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179491063215583866_621228626afc29a89159f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：譚旻萱IG）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179292968085091343_17621832696addef91398f4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"譚旻萱 黃澤林 譚旻萱火速撻着黃澤林！（圖片來源：threads）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/179292968085091343_17621832696addef91398f4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>譚旻萱火速撻着黃澤林！（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179067539353731818_8243082886abb89c1e8af8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"譚旻萱 黃澤林 陳康堤每次都愛得高調，今次與黃澤林的戀情更獲母親徐濠縈認可，徐濠縈私下稱呼他為「黃Sir」，而黃澤林則稱呼她為「Auntie」，早前陳氏一家三口都有在社交媒體祝賀Coleman的好成績，到今次亞運已再無互動。（圖片來源：IG@_constancec_）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/179067539353731818_8243082886abb89c1e8af8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>陳康堤每次都愛得高調，今次與黃澤林的戀情更獲母親徐濠縈認可，徐濠縈私下稱呼他為「黃Sir」，而黃澤林則稱呼她為「Auntie」，早前陳氏一家三口都有在社交媒體祝賀Coleman的好成績，到今次亞運已再無互動。（圖片來源：IG@_constancec_）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%ad%9a%e6%97%bb%e8%90%b1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">譚旻萱</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e5%ba%b7%e5%a0%a4/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳康堤</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%bb%83%e6%be%a4%e6%9e%97/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">黃澤林</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3544817\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 17 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T11:53:27.627239+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1438,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T10:17:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T11:46:55.184960+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T11:46:55.184960+00:00","content_hash":"616538d7016ae4b72c5f44366bce4a5d7a6dac8ae0a94162d09fe300a024ea00","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}